            <field>
              <name>TYPE0</name>
              <description>Port A-h Pin[n] Edge or Level Detection Interrupt Trigger Type Control\nTYPE (Px_INTTYPE[n]) bit is used to control the triggered interrupt is by level trigger or by edge trigger. If the interrupt is by edge trigger, the trigger source can be controlled by de-bounce. If the interrupt is by level trigger, the input source is sampled by one HCLK clock and generates the interrupt.</description>
