              <description>Tamper 1 Detect Enable Bit\nNote1: The reference is RTC-clock. Tamper detector need sync 2 ~ 3 RTC-clock.</description>
              <bitOffset>12</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <enumeratedValues>
