            <field>
              <name>PSCNT0</name>
              <description>EPWM Trigger EADC Prescale Counter 0\nUser can monitor PSCNT0 to know the current value in 4-bit trigger EADC prescale counter.\nNote1: user can write only when PSCEN0 is 0.\nNote2: Write data limitation: PSCNT0  EADCPSC0.</description>
