              <description>Alignment Error Interrupt Enable Bit\nThe ALIEIEN controls the ALIEIF (EMAC_INTSTS[5]) interrupt generation. If ALIEIF (EMAC_INTSTS[5]) is set, and both ALIEIEN and RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) are enabled, the EMAC generates the RX interrupt to CPU. If ALIEIEN or RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) is disabled, no RX interrupt is generated to CPU even the ALIEIF (EMAC_INTSTS[5]) is set.</description>
              <bitOffset>5</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <enumeratedValues>
                 <enumeratedValue>
                    <name>0</name>
                    <description>ALIEIF (EMAC_INTSTS[5]) trigger RX interrupt Disabled</description>
