            <field>
              <name>MPCOVIEN</name>
              <description>Miss Packet Counter Overrun Interrupt Enable Bit\nThe MPCOVIEN controls the MPCOVIF (EMAC_INTSTS[7]) interrupt generation. If MPCOVIF (EMAC_INTSTS[7]) is set, and both MPCOVIEN and RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) are enabled, the EMAC generates the RX interrupt to CPU. If MPCOVIEN or RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) is disabled, no RX interrupt is generated to CPU even the MPCOVIF (EMAC_INTSTS[7]) is set.</description>
