              <description>DMA Early Notification Interrupt Enable Bit\nThe DENIEN controls the DENIF (EMAC_INTSTS[9]) interrupt generation. If DENIF (EMAC_INTSTS[9]) is set, and both DENIEN and RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) are enabled, the EMAC generates the RX interrupt to CPU. If DENIEN or RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) is disabled, no RX interrupt is generated to CPU even the DENIF (EMAC_INTSTS[9]) is set.</description>
              <bitOffset>9</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
