            </field>
            <field>
              <name>RDUIEN</name>
              <description>Receive Descriptor Unavailable Interrupt Enable Bit\nThe RDUIEN controls the RDUIF (EMAC_INTSTS[10]) interrupt generation. If RDUIF (EMAC_INTSTS[10]) is set, and both RDUIEN and RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) are enabled, the EMAC generates the RX interrupt to CPU. If RDUIEN or RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) is disabled, no RX interrupt is generated to CPU even the RDUIF (EMAC_MIOSTA[10]) register is set.</description>
              <bitOffset>10</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <enumeratedValues>
