            <field>
              <name>WOLIEN</name>
              <description>Wake on LAN Interrupt Enable Bit\nThe WOLIEN controls the WOLIF (EMAC_INTSTS[15]) interrupt generation. If WOLIF (EMAC_INTSTS[15]) is set, and both WOLIEN and RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) are enabled, the EMAC generates the RX interrupt to CPU. If WOLIEN or RXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[0]) is disabled, no RX interrupt is generated to CPU even the WOLIF (EMAC_INTSTS[15]) is set.</description>
              <bitOffset>15</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>1</bitWidth>
              <enumeratedValues>
