              <access>read-write</access>
            </field>
            <field>
              <name>TXUDIEN</name>
              <description>Transmit FIFO Underflow Interrupt Enable Bit\nThe TXUDIEN controls the TXUDIF (EMAC_INTSTS[17]) interrupt generation. If TXUDIF (EMAC_INTSTS[17]) is set, and both TXUDIEN and TXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[16]) are enabled, the EMAC generates the TX interrupt to CPU. If TXUDIEN or TXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[16]) is disabled, no TX interrupt is generated to CPU even the TXUDIF (EMAC_INTSTS[17]) is set.</description>
