            </field>
            <field>
              <name>EXDEFIEN</name>
              <description>Defer Exceed Interrupt Enable Bit\nThe EXDEFIEN controls the EXDEFIF (EMAC_INTSTS[19]) interrupt generation. If EXDEFIF (EMAC_INTSTS[19]) is set, and both EXDEFIEN and TXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[16]) are enabled, the EMAC generates the TX interrupt to CPU. If EXDEFIEN or TXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[16]) is disabled, no TX interrupt is generated to CPU even the EXDEFIF (EMAC_INTSTS[19]) is set.</description>
