            <field>
              <name>NCSIEN</name>
              <description>No Carrier Sense Interrupt Enable Bit\nThe NCSIEN controls the NCSIF (EMAC_INTSTS[20]) interrupt generation. If NCSIF (EMAC_INTSTS[20]) is set, and both NCSIEN and TXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[16]) are enabled, the EMAC generates the TX interrupt to CPU. If NCSIEN or TXIEN (EMAC_INTEN[16]) is disabled, no TX interrupt is generated to CPU even the NCSIF (EMAC_INTSTS[20]) is set.</description>
